WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.560
Key takeaway A transfer needs a defined assignment usable access

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:11.510
and explicit acceptance A sent attachment is not enough Escalate

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:15.720
an unaccepted gap without abandoning work or assuming unlimited personal

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.375
availability
